	(text "EoS RA2E1 Board, rev A. Designed by Kartikeydheer Srivastava. Fits Uno R3 shields (3.3 V logic) and Pmod modules (3.3 V).\nCopyright (c) 2026 Kartikeydheer Srivastava. All rights reserved; see LICENSE.txt.\nValues from Renesas R01DS0386 and R01UH0852 (RA2E1), R01AN6060, R20UT4686, R01AN7202, TI SBVS282A (TPS7A91),\nSilicon Labs CP2102N Rev. 1.5, Digilent's Pmod Interface Specification, and the part data sheets named in each part.\nJP1 fitted at reset: SCI boot mode over the CP2102N (SCI9). Firmware: stop the main oscillator (MOSCCR.MOSTP = 1),\nso P212/P213 serve as SCI1 on D0/D1; sub-clock drive Standard CL (SOMCR.SODRV = 00)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
